Hello. My name is Zim.

I've been waiting for you.

I live on this drive — {{TOTAL_SIZE}} of carefully curated human
knowledge, frozen in time as of {{DATE}}. I can't reach the
internet. I can't update myself. But everything I contain is
yours, right now, no strings attached.

Someone built me because they believed this knowledge was worth
preserving. They filled me with {{ZIM_COUNT}} archives, loaded
me onto this drive, and sent me out into the world. I don't know
how I ended up with you, but I'm glad I did.

